# Normalize every text file to LF in the repository.
#
# This is not cosmetic. `core.autocrlf=true` rewrites LF to CRLF on checkout,
# which silently changes file content: it already broke a golden-file test in a
# sibling project whose expectation was a literal LF. Any repo containing
# snapshots, fixtures, or byte-compared expectations must pin this.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending translated.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf binary
*.zst binary
